;; bin/java-project test's :jdk-extra case (A15, GH13 (a)): a JDK module as the program's world extension, java.xml
;; cut by A3 from org.xml.sax.SAXParseException (three files: SAXException and Locator reached; the rest of java.xml
;; the platform's), read by read-jdk with --patch-module, both fronts and nread equal, its resources (the module's
;; messages, the JDK catalog) by module before app's, one variant (javac's world's SecuritySupport) named by
;; outside.args; the light proof of the per-program extension, test/programs-pending/xml its program
{:java {:release 25
        :jdk-extra [{:module "java.xml"
                     :closure {:roots ["org.xml.sax.SAXParseException"]}
                     :variants ["$arbace/overlay/jdk/javac/variants/SecuritySupport.ae"]}]
        :modules [{:name "app" :src ["$controls/jdk-extra-src"]}]}}
